{"2680440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "MONOWAVE", "steam_appid": 2680440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>MONOWAVE</strong></i> is a puzzle adventure game following the journey of <i><strong>Mono</strong></i>, a newborn Guardian spirit destined to protect the four Emotions: <strong>Anger</strong>, <strong>Anxiety</strong>, <strong>Happiness</strong>, and <strong>Sorrow</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680440/extras/66d312633fb69fcb2dc79f0f24c6acc4.avif?t=1788166068\" width=1560 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For as long as one can remember, the four Emotions were guided and nurtured by the Prism Tree at the heart of the world. Everything changed, however, when the Emotion Shards within the Prism suddenly vanished, scattering the Emotions across the land. Upon their disappearance, the Prism Tree began to wither, throwing the world into chaos. It’s up to the newborn Guardian, Mono, to reunite the wayward Emotions and restore harmony to the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680440/extras/41ae7535dc90f2e2a330bea1c81fc6b7.avif?t=1788166068\" width=1560 height=438 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680440/extras/76135fa3f55e760a6c786591ea5960c0.webp?t=1788166068\" width=639 height=20 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>4 Unique Emotions &amp; Powers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the guardian spirit of Emotions, you’ll be able to harness special powers based on <strong>Anxiety</strong>, <strong>Anger</strong>, <strong>Sorrow</strong>, and <strong>Happiness</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680440/extras/e7ee62f9c15b4f87ab1f244f5c7e6bb2.poster.avif?t=1788166068\" width=638 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680440/extras/e7ee62f9c15b4f87ab1f244f5c7e6bb2.webm?t=1788166068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680440/extras/e7ee62f9c15b4f87ab1f244f5c7e6bb2.mp4?t=1788166068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Happiness</strong>: Jump to reach new heights. Nothing can stop your glee!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sorrow</strong>: Dive underwater and flow through subterranean passageways to reach unexplored depths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anger</strong>: Wall-jump with the power of your fury to pave a path forward.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anxiety</strong>: Evade potential threats and navigate difficult terrain with your heightened senses.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680440/extras/961d6d2762c27d160797fde1e2035f1c.webp?t=1788166068\" width=639 height=20 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Heartfelt Journey of Empathy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our emotions may be turbulent and unpredictable, but they are ultimately what make us human. Uncover a heartfelt story about the complicated but meaningful ways different emotions manifest in our lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680440/extras/06b703144647c1ed7c92a2f01920d29a.poster.avif?t=1788166068\" width=638 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680440/extras/06b703144647c1ed7c92a2f01920d29a.webm?t=1788166068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680440/extras/06b703144647c1ed7c92a2f01920d29a.mp4?t=1788166068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680440/extras/76d3999cc338f7036074bbfa0a647d78.webp?t=1788166068\" width=639 height=20 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Colorful Cast of Characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with the eccentric inhabitants of this world. Your powers will resonate with them and affect their behaviors. Will they be friend, or foe? It all depends on your approach…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680440/extras/34942a64dc6725fa594195452e25d028.poster.avif?t=1788166068\" width=638 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680440/extras/34942a64dc6725fa594195452e25d028.webm?t=1788166068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680440/extras/34942a64dc6725fa594195452e25d028.mp4?t=1788166068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680440/extras/14a84ca3038e28d1c10281370d1e4687.webp?t=1788166068\" width=639 height=20 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Four Unique Worlds</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse four unique realms, each warped by the fierce might of its ruling Emotion. From foggy jungles to blazing caverns, it’s up to you to restore balance to each Emotion-based ecosystem!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680440/extras/6ac7cb43da34fa5a147620f968133210.poster.avif?t=1788166068\" width=638 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680440/extras/6ac7cb43da34fa5a147620f968133210.webm?t=1788166068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680440/extras/6ac7cb43da34fa5a147620f968133210.mp4?t=1788166068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680440/extras/76135fa3f55e760a6c786591ea5960c0.webp?t=1788166068\" width=639 height=20 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Whimsical Art Style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a graphics style reminiscent of scratch art from one’s childhood, MONOWAVE evokes a timeless fairytale with universal appeal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680440/extras/52419130fa8ce86509e1186d3e84a4a3.poster.avif?t=1788166068\" width=638 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680440/extras/52419130fa8ce86509e1186d3e84a4a3.webm?t=1788166068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680440/extras/52419130fa8ce86509e1186d3e84a4a3.mp4?t=1788166068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680440/extras/961d6d2762c27d160797fde1e2035f1c.webp?t=1788166068\" width=639 height=20 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Original Soundtrack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of MONOWAVE is brought to life with an all-original, exclusive soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680440/extras/9f40006f9dedacfb4e0c61dc8673c076.poster.avif?t=1788166068\" width=638 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680440/extras/9f40006f9dedacfb4e0c61dc8673c076.webm?t=1788166068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680440/extras/9f40006f9dedacfb4e0c61dc8673c076.mp4?t=1788166068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680440/extras/76d3999cc338f7036074bbfa0a647d78.webp?t=1788166068\" width=639 height=20 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Controller Support</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller operation is required for 2-player mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>MONOWAVE</strong></i> is a puzzle adventure game following the journey of <i><strong>Mono</strong></i>, a newborn Guardian spirit destined to protect the four Emotions: <strong>Anger</strong>, <strong>Anxiety</strong>, <strong>Happiness</strong>, and <strong>Sorrow</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680440/extras/66d312633fb69fcb2dc79f0f24c6acc4.avif?t=1788166068\" width=1560 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For as long as one can remember, the four Emotions were guided and nurtured by the Prism Tree at the heart of the world. Everything changed, however, when the Emotion Shards within the Prism suddenly vanished, scattering the Emotions across the land. Upon their disappearance, the Prism Tree began to wither, throwing the world into chaos. It’s up to the newborn Guardian, Mono, to reunite the wayward Emotions and restore harmony to the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680440/extras/41ae7535dc90f2e2a330bea1c81fc6b7.avif?t=1788166068\" width=1560 height=438 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680440/extras/76135fa3f55e760a6c786591ea5960c0.webp?t=1788166068\" width=639 height=20 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>4 Unique Emotions &amp; Powers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the guardian spirit of Emotions, you’ll be able to harness special powers based on <strong>Anxiety</strong>, <strong>Anger</strong>, <strong>Sorrow</strong>, and <strong>Happiness</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680440/extras/e7ee62f9c15b4f87ab1f244f5c7e6bb2.poster.avif?t=1788166068\" width=638 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680440/extras/e7ee62f9c15b4f87ab1f244f5c7e6bb2.webm?t=1788166068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680440/extras/e7ee62f9c15b4f87ab1f244f5c7e6bb2.mp4?t=1788166068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Happiness</strong>: Jump to reach new heights. Nothing can stop your glee!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sorrow</strong>: Dive underwater and flow through subterranean passageways to reach unexplored depths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anger</strong>: Wall-jump with the power of your fury to pave a path forward.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Anxiety</strong>: Evade potential threats and navigate difficult terrain with your heightened senses.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680440/extras/961d6d2762c27d160797fde1e2035f1c.webp?t=1788166068\" width=639 height=20 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Heartfelt Journey of Empathy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our emotions may be turbulent and unpredictable, but they are ultimately what make us human. Uncover a heartfelt story about the complicated but meaningful ways different emotions manifest in our lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680440/extras/06b703144647c1ed7c92a2f01920d29a.poster.avif?t=1788166068\" width=638 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset