ystem!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680440/extras/6ac7cb43da34fa5a147620f968133210.poster.avif?t=1788166068\" width=638 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680440/extras/6ac7cb43da34fa5a147620f968133210.webm?t=1788166068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680440/extras/6ac7cb43da34fa5a147620f968133210.mp4?t=1788166068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680440/extras/76135fa3f55e760a6c786591ea5960c0.webp?t=1788166068\" width=639 height=20 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Whimsical Art Style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a graphics style reminiscent of scratch art from one’s childhood, MONOWAVE evokes a timeless fairytale with universal appeal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680440/extras/52419130fa8ce86509e1186d3e84a4a3.poster.avif?t=1788166068\" width=638 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680440/extras/52419130fa8ce86509e1186d3e84a4a3.webm?t=1788166068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680440/extras/52419130fa8ce86509e1186d3e84a4a3.mp4?t=1788166068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2680440/e